            %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#SLGrupOnPaulimatrices"}
            are the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/spin+groups"} spin groups
            (def.
            %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#SpinGroup"}
