                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \{\Gamma_0, \Gamma_1, \Gamma_2, \cdots, \Gamma_{d-1}\}
              in odd degree (“Clifford generators”), subject to the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/generators+and+relations"} relation
