                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \mathbb{R}^{d-1,1}
              is identified with the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/anti-commutator"} anti-commutator
              in the Clifford algebra
            .maruku-equation
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi η
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
